      "note": [
        "From the reference year 2025 onwards, a small controlled random uncertainty is introduced in all reported data. The uncertainty has been added to protect individuals so that no one risks being exposed in the statistics. As a result, the reported totals are not always equal to the sum of their reported components.  \r\n \r\n  \r\nIf reported statistical values are added together to create a new total, the uncertainty is also added. There is therefore a risk that the new total contains greater uncertainty than that which – under the method – would have been added to a single value. \r\n \r\n  \r\nThe method used for disclosure control is called Cell Key Method (CKM). You can read more about the method here: [Protection methods for disclosure control](https://www.scb.se/en/documentation/statististical-methods/protection-methods-for-disclosure-control/) and here: [Development of disclosure protection](https://www.scb.se/en/documentation/statistical-areas-under-change/development-of-disclosure-protection/).",
        "From 1 May 2014 EU citizens no longer need to register their migration at the Swedish Migration Board.",
        "Grouping used in this table.\r\n\r\n\r\nStudies\r\n- students non EU / EEA citizens\r\n- students EU / EEA citizens \r\n\r\n\r\nWork\r\n- labour non EU / EEA citizens\r\n- workers EU / EEA citizens\r\n- self-employed EU / EEA citizen \r\n\r\n\r\nRelatives - no refugees\r\n- relatives to EU / EEA citizens\r\n- labour, familie members to non-EU / EEA nationals\r\n- family members to non-EU / EEA nationals\r\n- adopted children non EU / EEA citizens \r\n\r\n\r\nRelatives - refugees\r\n- relatives to refugees \r\n\r\n\r\nRefugees/protection status\r\n- convention refugees\r\n- persons in need of protection\r\n- particularly distressing circumstances\r\n- permit under a temporary law non EU / EEA citizens\r\n- other permits, refugees non EU / EEA citizens \r\n\r\n\r\nOthers\r\n- non EU / EEA citizens resident in another EU country\r\n- sufficient funds EU / EEA citizens\r\n- other permits non EU / EEA citizens\r\n- residence permit",
        "Only citizenship, with at least 20 immigrants, the rest are reported under other citizenship.",
        "Information about the statistics, read the document Grundforbosattning_Information, https://www.scb.se/contentassets/1d93421897a845e8ad3e2edc7faf06fc/grund-for-bosattning-information.pdf"
